{"seq":4,"slug":"network-engineering","title":"网络工程技术","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":8,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"网络工程技术-简介\">网络工程技术 简介</h1><p>网络工程技术是职业本科教育中面向数字基础设施建设的核心工科专业，对接网络工程师、系统运维工程师、网络安全工程师等高技能岗位，培养能够独立完成企业级网络规划设计、部署实施、安全防护与智能运维的高端技术技能人才。随着5G商用深化、云原生架构普及和算力网络加速建设，企业对具备网络自动化与云网融合能力的复合型工程人才需求持续攀升。</p>\n<p>本专业课程体系以&quot;协议原理+架构设计+安全防护+云网融合&quot;四层递进为主线，学生既需掌握TCP/IP协议栈、路由交换等经典网络技术，又需具备SDN/NFV、容器网络、零信任安全等新一代网络能力，最终形成覆盖网络全生命周期的工程实践能力。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>网络基础与协议</strong>建立计算机网络的理论根基，涵盖OSI与TCP/IP模型解析、路由交换基础技术、无线网络技术三大模块，使学生掌握数据包从发送到接收的完整通信原理。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>网络架构设计</strong>聚焦真实工程场景，深入讲解园区网络规划设计、数据中心网络架构、网络自动化与DevOps三个方向，培养学生从需求分析到方案落地的系统设计能力。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>网络安全防御</strong>围绕网络安全体系建设，涵盖防火墙与入侵检测、密码学与VPN技术、安全运营与应急响应三个维度，使学生具备构建纵深防御体系和处理安全事件的实战能力。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>云网与新兴技术</strong>面向网络技术演进前沿，通过云计算与虚拟化、SDN/NFV架构、5G与物联网边缘计算三个方向，培养学生把握网络技术发展方向和驾驭新技术的前瞻能力。</p>\n<p>建议学习路径：先通过第一章扎实掌握网络协议和通信原理，再在第二章学习网络工程设计方法论，然后在第三章建立安全意识与防御技能，最终在第四章把握云网融合和5G/IoT等新兴趋势。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"network-fundamentals-protocols","title":"网络基础与协议","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-fundamentals-protocols","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"osi-tcpip-model","title":"OSI与TCP/IP模型","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-fundamentals-protocols/osi-tcpip-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"routing-switching-fundamentals","title":"路由交换基础技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-fundamentals-protocols/routing-switching-fundamentals"},{"seq":3,"slug":"wireless-network-technology","title":"无线网络技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-fundamentals-protocols/wireless-network-technology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-fundamentals","title":"网络基础理论","docCount":0,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-fundamentals","docs":[]},{"seq":3,"slug":"network-architecture-design","title":"网络架构设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-architecture-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"campus-network-design","title":"园区网络规划设计","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-architecture-design/campus-network-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"datacenter-network-architecture","title":"数据中心网络架构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-architecture-design/datacenter-network-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"network-automation-devops","title":"网络自动化与DevOps","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-architecture-design/network-automation-devops"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"network-infrastructure","title":"网络基础设施","docCount":0,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-infrastructure","docs":[]},{"seq":5,"slug":"network-security-defense","title":"网络安全防御","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-security-defense","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"firewall-intrusion-detection","title":"防火墙与入侵检测","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-security-defense/firewall-intrusion-detection"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cryptography-vpn-technology","title":"密码学与VPN技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-security-defense/cryptography-vpn-technology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"security-operations-response","title":"安全运营与应急响应","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-security-defense/security-operations-response"}]},{"seq":6,"slug":"network-security","title":"网络安全","docCount":0,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/network-security","docs":[]},{"seq":7,"slug":"cloud-network-emerging-tech","title":"云网与新兴技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/cloud-network-emerging-tech","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cloud-computing-virtualization","title":"云计算与虚拟化","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/cloud-network-emerging-tech/cloud-computing-virtualization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sdn-nfv-architecture","title":"SDN与NFV架构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/cloud-network-emerging-tech/sdn-nfv-architecture"},{"seq":3,"slug":"5g-iot-edge-computing","title":"5G与物联网边缘计算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/cloud-network-emerging-tech/5g-iot-edge-computing"}]},{"seq":8,"slug":"cloud-network-operations","title":"云网运维","docCount":0,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/network-engineering/cloud-network-operations","docs":[]}]}